00:01:43.967 --> 00:01:49.207
was found guilty of inciting unrest and sentenced to four years. Three judges acquitted him of treason,

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:54.467
saying prosecutors had failed to prove a key element. He denied the charges and called the prosecution

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:59.447
