00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:34.507
remarks also put online were a lawful reform campaign taken out of context.

00:02:35.027 --> 00:02:38.687
Chidema wanted commissioners appointed independently, police letting parties

00:02:38.687 --> 00:02:43.167
